So i’ve changed the argument verbose, but I still do not get elements in $k.by.p. Now I get a new warning and the object is still NULL. I get the same message disregarding the optimization method (burn or mean).

I’ll talk to my coautores about both optimization methods (mean or burn), because I believe that in our case, we shouldn't assume that all shape variables have the same lambda, I would say that is more accurate to use the method “mean” which at least takes into account that lambda is not the same for each variable.

